Package: fatrat-common
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: python3-pip, git
Description: download manager - common files
 FatRat is a download manager supporting HTTP(S), FTP(S), BitTorrent,
 RSS feeds, Python extensions and a web interface.
 .
 This package contains the files shared by the desktop (fatrat) and
 the headless (fatrat-nogui) versions: the web interface, Python
 extension support files, translations and the fatrat-conf tool.

Package: fatrat
Architecture: any
Depends: fatrat-common (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: qt6-svg-plugins
Description: download manager - Qt desktop version
 FatRat is a download manager supporting HTTP(S), FTP(S), BitTorrent,
 RSS feeds, Python extensions and a web interface.
 .
 This package contains the Qt desktop application.

Package: fatrat-nogui
Architecture: any
Depends: fatrat-common (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: download manager - headless version and terminal UI
 FatRat is a download manager supporting HTTP(S), FTP(S), BitTorrent,
 RSS feeds, Python extensions and a web interface.
 .
 This package contains fatrat-nogui, a version without a graphical
 user interface that is controlled through the web interface, and
 fatrat-tui, a terminal (ncurses) client which can start fatrat-nogui
 or connect to a running FatRat.
